# Force LF line endings on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts convert LF to CRLF (core.autocrlf) and
# `gofmt -l` flags every .go file as unformatted, breaking the CI matrix
# Windows leg. Git auto-detects binary files, so they are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep deliberately-vulnerable fixture data out of GitHub's language
# statistics and "vendored" in the UI — it is test data, not the
# product. Aegis itself is the Go code in cmd/ and internal/.
benchmark/** linguist-vendored
docs/audit/** linguist-vendored
tests/demos/** linguist-vendored
tests/fixtures/** linguist-vendored
demo/** linguist-vendored
internal/regression/** linguist-vendored
**/testdata/** linguist-vendored
